          <para>rustc, cargo-c, cosmic-icons, wayland, and libxkbcommon</para>

    </sect2>

      <sect2 role="installation">
        <title>Installation of Cosmic-term</title>

    <para>Prepare Cosmic-term for compilation:</para>

      <para>To Build the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="make">export VERGEN_GIT_COMMIT_DATE='Tue Oct 20 13:46:25 2026 -0600' &amp;&amp;
export VERGEN_GIT_SHA=699ac42384b917029082d45a01a9261a4ba75c45 &amp;&amp;

cargo build --release --offline</userinput></screen>

      <para>Now Install the Package, issue:</para>

        <screen><userinput remap="install">install -vDm755 target/release/cosmic-term /usr/bin/cosmic-term &amp;&amp;

install -vDm644 target/xdgen/com.system76.CosmicTerm.desktop \
  /usr/share/applications/com.system76.CosmicTerm.desktop &amp;&amp;
install -vDm644 target/xdgen/com.system76.CosmicTerm.metainfo.xml \
  /usr/share/metainfo/com.system76.CosmicTerm.metainfo.xml &amp;&amp;

cp -rv res/icons/hicolor/. /usr/share/icons/hicolor/</userinput></screen>

        <screen><userinput remap="post">unset VERGEN_GIT_COMMIT_DATE VERGEN_GIT_SHA &amp;&amp;
gtk-update-icon-cache -qtf /usr/share/icons/hicolor
</userinput></screen>

      </sect2>

